  <Overview>mdf-server Prod (fresh deploy on unraid-public, native Tailscale-in-container).&#13;
Tailscale hostname mdf-server-prod, joined to pygmy-bramble.&#13;
0.3.0: x402 v2, multi-rail pricing (Base USDC 8453 / Base Sepolia 84532 / lnbtc),&#13;
Valkey-backed replay + token store, NWC invoice minting.&#13;
Auth key is placeholder - Gary will set real key via Unraid UI.&#13;
Runs as root for the Tailscale hook, drops to bun (uid 1000) via su-exec for the app.&#13;
ACL: needs tag:misc-services grant for port 3000 (Gary to apply).&#13;
</Overview>
